Echo upstream (https://github.com/lcm7341/Echo/) does not ship a LICENSE file.
GitHub reports no detected license for that repository.

This directory is a Geode SDK port of that project. It does not add a new
license and does not relicense the original work. Copyright in the Echo
gameplay, macro format, and feature design remains with the original author,
lcm7341, and the people credited in the upstream README:

- matcool (https://github.com/matcool)
- Aly (https://github.com/s5bug)
- andre (https://github.com/AndreNih)

No more restrictive terms are added by this port. If you need rights beyond
what the upstream author granted, ask them. Absence of a license on the
upstream repository means you should treat the original code as all rights
reserved aside from whatever GitHub's fork/contribution flow already allows.

This port does not vendor upstream third-party trees. Those components keep
their own licenses and are not included here:

- Dear ImGui (libraries/imgui-hook/imgui/LICENSE.txt in the upstream repo)
- imgui-hook by Aly
- ImGuiFileDialog and its stb/dirent licenses
- miniaudio, MinHook, nlohmann/json, simdjson, FMOD headers, and cocos/gd.h
  as pulled by the upstream CMake build
